      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Doors - 5:00PM Show - 6:00PM      All Ages     From CA$55       Experience “Mestiat”, the first Tigrinya frame play by Hagos Weldegebriel Debesay (Suzinino).  Join us for  Suzinino in Winnipeg , a unique live performance experience featuring  “Mestyat” —the first Tigrinya  frame play , written, dire"
      }
