      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Tired Cossack returns with his full band to celebrate the release of his third LP, \"ZIMA.\" The show promises to strike like winter's last storm as post-punk, grunge, and shoegaze mix with the energy and fervour that typify Tired Cossack's live shows.  Joined by the exceptional shoegaze act"
