      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Guitar Night 3: The Trilogy…  brings three powerhouse guitar-driven acts together for one explosive night at the West End Cultural Centre. Featuring Ash and the Arsonists, Ronnie Ladobruk, and Leddwyn. This showcase celebrates blistering solos, heavy riffs, and high octane performances from some of"
