    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Stand-up Comedy   A dentist-turned-comedian, he has taken the comedy circuit by storm with his unique style and engaging stage presence. Gaurav’s humor often revolves around family dynamics, middle-class struggles, and the quirks of Indian society, making him relatable to audiences across the globe."
      }
