      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "A Mid Winter celebration of Manitoba made Alt/Rock music. 8 Bands 1 ticket. Jan 10th West End Cultural Centre  Come and join us for an amazing night of Manitoba Made Alt Rock!!! 8 bands 1 ticket!! lots of extras and good times!! Wear a toque! (It’s inside though)"
      }
