        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Queer BINGO!    QUEER BINGO returns to the West End Cultural Centre! In support of Like That, Sunshine House's drop-in for 2SLGBTQIA+ folks!   Enjoy drag performances, good company and bingo! Just $20 gets you a stack of cards to play bingo all night. No advance sales — door only!   Gender neutral a"
