        "@value": "Dark Purple Slice    Bruce McCulloch’s Dark Purple Slice is a one-man show that moves brilliantly between funny, relatable and uplifting. Combining touching and hilarious stories with poetic observations on life and the things we do, Bruce takes the audience on an unforgettable journey. As the \""
