        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Punk  .  FEAR The legendary California Hard Core Punk band formed in 1977 comes to Winnipeg!  NEGATIVE CHARGE What we have here is a 12 slice of abject ferocity. Filled out with members of every good Winnipeg Punk band from the last 2 decades, Negative Charge have concocted one hell of a debut. This"
      }
