    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Winnipeg Jazz Orchestra (WJO)   In 1964 Stan Getz and vocalist Astrud Gilberto introduced American audiences to the Bossa Nova with their Grammy-winning record. The record was a commercial and artistic triumph and started a bonafide craze. Join the Winnipeg Jazz Orchestra (WJO), with vocalist Amber"
