        "@value": "An indie theatre production   Back by popular demand, Sick + Twisted Theatre, Winnipeg’s own disability theatre company, is thrilled to announce their 3rd annual production of ‘A Merry Crip-mas Panto!’ — a bold, joyful celebration of inclusion, laughter, and the spirit of the season, bigger and bett"
      }
    ],
