        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Savio has had to postpone this show for travel reasons. He and his team are not able to make it to Winnipeg, so we’re rescheduling to a new date in the Spring. All ticket holders will be refunded.  ~~   Wonderstruck &nbsp;is an unforgettable night where the ordinary gets turned on its head, and"
