        "@value": "Started in 2016, the WECC in partnership with West End Biz presents a free weekly summertime lunchtime concert series called Musical Notes and Lunch Totes at Saigon Park (on Ellice between Spence and Balmoral). This series provides the WECC, artists, and members of the community the opportunity to c"
      }
