        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Schools and Educational Networks are invited to a free afternoon concert at the West End Cultural Centre. The WECC presents Frontiers School Division’s   Frontier Fiddlers  .  Door 1pm  Show 2pm  Set: 50 min     RSVP to        info@wecc.ca       with what school you are coming from and how many peop"
