        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The Tune-In Music Program has been an integral part of the West End Cultural Centre for almost as long as the WECC has been around. We offer free music instruction on the guitar, bass, drums, voice, and songwriting for youth ages 8-18.  Professional musicians provide two hours of instruction and men"
