        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The WECC Co-Working Space   A lot of us work from home. And while that can offer flexibility and freedom, it can also get lonely. And in the summer months it can also get hot!  The WECC is offering co-working space in our theatre to share community, internet, and air conditioning. Added bonus: theat"
