      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "A FREE family friendly festival right in the street (and inside the WECC, and in King Cob Market Pub)!  2 nights and 1 day of live music! Family friendly entertainment, community booths, 25-cent hot dog cart, and more! Plus our friends at ArtBeat will host the Art From The Heart Market.  If it rains"
