        "@value": "Tune In Youth Music Lessons   This after school drop-in program offers free music instruction on the guitar, bass, drums, voice, and keyboards for youth ages 8-18. Professional musicians provide two hours of instruction and mentorship every Tuesday during the school year with all instruments provide"
